#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Large-scale hardware example {#large-scale-hardware-example}"
msgstr "Contoh hardware skala besar {#large-scale-hardware-example}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now, we run a larger example on real quantum hardware. Here, we'll derive an"
" active space for the nitrogen molecule from the cc-pVDZ basis set.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang, kita jalankan contoh yang lebih besar pada hardware kuantum nyata."
" Di sini, kita akan menurunkan ruang aktif untuk molekul nitrogen dari basis"
" set cc-pVDZ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Steps 1-4 {#steps-1-4}"
msgstr "Langkah 1-4 {#steps-1-4}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
