"- [Dokumentasi API addon SQD](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd/apidocs/qiskit_addon_sqd.fermion.html#qiskit_addon_sqd.fermion.diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian) - referensi untuk fungsi `diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian`\n"
"- [*Chemistry beyond the scale of exact diagonalization on a quantum-centric supercomputer*](https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/sciadv.adu9991) - makalah yang menjadi dasar tutorial ini\n"
